@startuml
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #FCE8E0
state "Patrol" as P
state "Investigate" as I
state "SpotPlayer" as S
state "Engage" as E
state "TakeCover" as T
state "Retreat" as R
P --> I: alerted by sound / returning
I --> P: no alert / return complete
P --> S: sees player; not engaged
S --> E: contact / engaged
E --> I: lost target, suppression over
E --> T: assignment not reached; cover window
T --> E: 
E --> R: retreat flag
R --> E: hold over
@enduml